{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beyond-the-grave/1360217-they-came-from-beyond-the-grave","id":1360217,"title":"They Came from Beyond the Grave!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","They Came From...","...Beyond the Grave!"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-10T15:46:31-08:00","id":1360217,"title":"They Came from Beyond the Grave!","content":"<a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/onyx-path-publishing-announces-they-came-from-beyond-the-grave-tabletop-rpg/\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path have announced working on the new game on <b>They Came From</b> series</a> - this time it will be horror, sex, suspense, and ham of early 1960s through to late 1970s horror movies in setting called <b>They Came from Beyond the Grave! </b>(referred to sometimes as <b>TCfBtG!</b>). New game will have Kickstarter later this year. Here is full sum up:<br /> <br /> '<b>They Came from Beyond the Grave!</b> draws from 60s and 70s horror films similarly to how <b>They Came from Beneath the Sea!</b> built off of the wonder, horror, thrills, and hilarity of 1950s science fiction. <b>They Came from Beyond the Grave!</b> (referred to sometimes as <b>TCfBtG!</b>) encompasses the horror, sex, suspense, and ham of early 1960s through to late 1970s horror movies. This game will be designed to evoke everything dramatic and theatrical of the classics from Hammer, Amicus, and Roger Corman libraries, along with other \u201cdark house\u201d movie gems, where mysteries take place in old manors, old vampires stalk guests, and something evil lurks in the woods.'<br /> <br /> From rumors Storyguide will be called her <b>Devil</b> - <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> - and Quips will be more scary than hilarious. But a lot of humor still will be in the game, as the main <b>From Beneath the Sea! </b>mechanics.<br /> <br /> What are your hopes and possible inspirations for this game, dear forumers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-10T15:58:16-08:00","id":1360218,"title":"","content":"How much game will be like 'Satanic Rites of Dracula'?<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eMAgmFScQvU\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eMAgmFScQvU\" data-code=\"eMAgmFScQvU\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/eMAgmFScQvU/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <img src=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eMAgmFScQvU\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <img src=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eMAgmFScQvU\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-10-2020, 07:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theo