Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-22T17:55:17-07:00","id":1404130,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beyond-the-grave/1360217-they-came-from-beyond-the-grave?p=1404126#post1404126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just contributed. Even though it's already funded, I would really really like to see it reach the stretch goal for the additional antagonists book. It was the mention of &amp;quot;Abaddon the Locust King&amp;quot; in the book outline that totally sold me on it, because I love (what I presume is) a good Exorcist 2 reference. (The movie is really terrible, but does include a ton of the Technicolor Gothic cheese that this game seems to be shooting for, so I take it as a good sign.)<br /> <br /> BTW, anyone even remotely interested in this game who has never seen the 70s tv series <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.nbc.com/kolchak-the-night-stalker/episodes&amp;quot;]Kolchak</a> the Night Stalker[/URL] really should do so.<br /> <br /> (And this really needs some sort of classic early edition World of Darkness crossover supplement at some point.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Definitely","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-22T23:12:12-07:00","id":1404185,"title":"","content":"We funded first Stretch Goal! '<b>Director\u2019s Screen!</b> \u2013 We\u2019ll create a <b>Director\u2019s Reference Screen</b> for <b>They Came from Beyond the Grave!</b>, which can be added to any reward tier containing a hardcover book for only +$20.<br /> <br /> At 32k $ we will start making the antagonists book for <b>Beyond the Grave</b> line - '<b>Monsters from the Crypt!</b> \u2013 A laboratory\u2019s worth of additional antagonists will be created and released in a supplemental <b>Monsters from the Crypt!</b> PDF, which will be added to the rewards list of all backers receiving the <b>They Came from Beyond the Grave! </b>Rulebook PDF.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-23T01:37:22-07:00","id":1404203,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beyond-the-grave/1360217-they-came-from-beyond-the-grave?p=1404126#post1404126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just contributed. Even though it's already funded, I would really really like to see it reach the stretch goal for the additional antagonists book. It was the mention of &amp;quot;Abaddon the Locust King&amp;quot; in the book outline that totally sold me on it, because I love (what I presume is) a good Exorcist 2 reference. (The movie is really terrible, but does include a ton of the Technicolor Gothic cheese that this game seems to be shooting for, so I take it as a good sign.)<br /> <br /> BTW, anyone even remotely interested in this game who has never seen the 70s tv series <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.nbc.com/kolchak-the-night-stalker/episodes&amp;quot;]Kolchak</a> the Night Stalker[/URL] really should do so.<br /> <br /> (And this really needs some sort of classic early edition World of Darkness crossover supplement at some point.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Exorcist II is probably among the worst complete features ever made. And yes, it is a reference.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-23T19:03:52-07:00","id":1404336,"title":"","content":"I think the real question on everyone's mind is, &quot;will there be Blackulas?&quot;<br /> <br /> Because I think if I was making a list of stuff I hope this game can do, that movie would be in the top five (probably with Kolchak, Dark Shadows, The Exorcist, and either The Abominable Dr. Phibes or The Car).<br /> <br /> Also, this game really needs an expansion entirely about psychics and psychic powers, perhaps as a crossover with a future game about 70s/80s alien invasion films (They Came from Beyond the Stars) like Night of the Creeps and The Blob remake.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-24T08:21:16-07:00","id":1404406,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beyond-the-grave/1360217-they-came-from-beyond-the-grave?p=1404336#post1404336\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the real question on everyone's mind is, &quot;will there be Blackulas?&quot;<br /> <br /> Because I think if I was making a list of stuff I hope this game can do, that movie would be in the top five (probably with Kolchak, Dark Shadows, The Exorcist, and either The Abominable Dr. Phibes or The Car).<br /> <br /> Also, this game really needs an expansion entirely about psychics and psychic powers, perhaps as a crossover with a future game about 70s/80s alien invasion films (They Came from Beyond the Stars) like Night of the Creeps and The Blob remake.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If we get our Monsters from the Crypt book, expect psychics aplenty!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-24T08:40:53-07:00","id":1404409,"title":"","content":"What about beds that eat?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]}